From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mingde-vp-chamber <chamber@localhost>
Date: Sat, 04 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] sms: skip slider captcha when captchaType is empty

Upstream CRMEB v6.0.0 `app/api/controller/v1/LoginController::verify()`
unconditionally calls `aj_captcha_check_two($captchaType, ...)`.
Mini-program clients that do not enable slider captcha send an empty
`captchaType`, `aj_get_serevice('')` throws, and SMS sending always fails.

Change: only run the second slider verification when a `captchaType` was
actually provided. Retired upstream-commit equivalent: 0791fbf8 (local-only,
unrecoverable; re-expressed here as a vendored patch).

Applies to: CRMEB-KY v6.0.0 (7dcddffff73ec542d689f159724296351f29ea9a)
Target dir: backend/crmeb/crmeb  (apply with: patch -p1 -d <runtime>)
---
 app/api/controller/v1/LoginController.php | 12 +++++++-----
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/app/api/controller/v1/LoginController.php b/app/api/controller/v1/LoginController.php
--- a/app/api/controller/v1/LoginController.php
+++ b/app/api/controller/v1/LoginController.php
@@ -173,10 +173,12 @@ public function verify(Request $request, SmsService $services)
 
         }
 
-        //二次验证
-        try {
-            aj_captcha_check_two($captchaType, $captchaVerification);
-        } catch (\Throwable $e) {
-            return app('json')->fail($e->getMessage());
+        //二次验证（captchaType 为空表示客户端未启用滑块验证码，直接跳过）
+        if ($captchaType !== '') {
+            try {
+                aj_captcha_check_two($captchaType, $captchaVerification);
+            } catch (\Throwable $e) {
+                return app('json')->fail($e->getMessage());
+            }
         }
 
         try {
